  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Using Diaspora to Transfer knowledge in Higher Education</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the IDF is to strenghten the Government of Mali&apos;s capacity for utilising the Malian Diaspora abroad for transfer knowledge through the TOKTEN program 1.   The development objective is to strengthen the capacity of the Ministry of Malians Living Abroad to expand the university teaching aspects of  the Transfer of Knowledge through Expatriate Nationals or Diaspora (TOKTEN) program.</narrative>
  </description>
